    "answer": "confession/acknowledgement/acknowledgment | confession-of-love/professing-one's-feelings | confession-of-sins-(e.g.-the-confessional)",
    "mnemonic": "To <kanji>announce</kanji> something and make it <kanji>white</kanji> is to make a <vocabulary>confession</vocabulary>. Think of a completely blank sheet of paper - your confession clears all the announcements from the sheet of paper, making it white.\n\nThis word is often used when someone confesses romantic feelings for someone else.",
